// DTAILibCompileCheck.src
// Library-only compile check. Uses just the DTAI library packages (no demo views),
// so it can be compiled with DataFlex 19.1 (DTAi-19.1.sws) as well as 25.0.
// The demo views in ai.src use 20.0+ classes (cWebView2Browser, cLocalWebControlHost)
// and are not expected to compile under 19.1.
Use DFAllEnt.pkg

Use claudeai.pkg
Use geminiai.pkg
Use grokai.pkg
Use chatgptai.pkg
Use docupipeai.pkg
Use cAIDemoToolSet.pkg   // demo tools shared by AIToolCallTest.vw and AIDialogueDemo.vw

Procedure DTAILibCompileCheck
    Handle hoAI
    tAIResponse Response
    Move ghoClaudeAI to hoAI
    Move ghoChatGPTAI to hoAI
    Move ghoGeminiAI to hoAI
    Move ghoGrokAI to hoAI
End_Procedure
